OlivineCity_Text_RsBrendan::
	.string "When you’re this far away from the\n"
	.string "city, the sky at night is fantastic.$"

OlivineCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "Wow, you have a POKéDEX!\n"
	.string "That is just so awesome.$"

OlivineCity_Text_Sailor::
	.string "Hello, laddie!\n"
	.string "The sea is sweet!\p"
	.string "Sing with me!\n"
	.string "Yo-ho! Blow the man down!…$"

OlivineCity_Text_Sailor2::
	.string "Dark roads are dangerous at\n"
	.string "night.\p"
	.string "But in the pitch-black of\n"
	.string "night, the sea is even more\l"
	.string "treacherous!\p"
	.string "Without the beacon of the LIGHTHOUSE\n"
	.string "to guide it, no ship can sail.$"

OlivineCity_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You again?\p"
	.string "There’s no need to panic. I don’t\n"
	.string "bother with wimps like you.\p"
	.string "Speaking of weaklings, the city’s\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER isn’t here.\p"
	.string "Supposedly taking care of a sick\n"
	.string "POKéMON at the LIGHTHOUSE.\p"
	.string "Humph! Boo-hoo!\n"
	.string "Just let sick POKéMON go!\p"
	.string "A POKéMON that can’t battle is\n"
	.string "worthless!\p"
	.string "Why don’t you go train at the\n"
	.string "LIGHTHOUSE?\p"
	.string "Who knows. It may make you a bit\n"
	.string "less weak!$"

